        +breadcrumbNav('', 'breadcrumb-menu','share', { link: 'index.html', text: 'Home', id: 'Home'},{ link: 'media-centre.html', text: 'Latest Updates', id: 'latest-updates'},{ link: 'news.html', text: 'News', id: 'news'}, { link: 'news.html', text: 'Corporate Registers Forum - 2024 Annual Conference', id: activeLink})
        +section('updates py-60') 
            .row
                .col-12
                    .news-details-page.event-details-page
                        +newsList(
                            {dateMonth: '23 Jan 2025',type:'International', text: 'Corporate Registers Forum - 2024 Annual Conference',image:'assets/images/news-detail.png'})
            .row 
                .col-md-8
                    .news-content.pe-5

                        p.fs-20.fw-semibold.text-secondary 
                            | Overview 
                        p.fs-20.fw-normal.text-secondary
                            | The Corporate Registers Forum (CRF) 2024 Annual Conference brings together leaders, regulators, and experts from around the world to discuss the future of business registries, governance, and transparency. Hosted in [Location, e.g., Doha, Qatar], this year’s conference serves as a global platform for knowledge exchange, policy dialogue, and best practices in corporate registration and business regulation.
                            br
                            br
                        p.fs-20.fw-semibold.text-secondary 
                            | Event Highlights
                            ul.list-styled-disc
                                li.fs-20.fw-normal.text-secondary Global Insights: Engage with registry officials and thought leaders from over 60 jurisdictions. 
                                li.fs-20.fw-normal.text-secondary Expert Panels: Explore key topics such as digital transformation, regulatory innovation, and corporate transparency.
                                li.fs-20.fw-normal.text-secondary Networking Opportunities: Build meaningful connections with global peers, government representatives, and industry professionals.
                                li.fs-20.fw-normal.text-secondary Workshops & Case Studies: Gain practical knowledge through interactive sessions led by international experts.
                            br
                            br
                        p.fs-20.fw-semibold.text-secondary 
                            | Theme
                        p.fs-20.fw-normal.text-secondary.italic “Innovation, Integrity, and Inclusion in Corporate Governance”
                        p.fs-20.fw-normal.text-secondary
                            | This year’s theme focuses on advancing corporate registry systems through technology, collaboration, and ethical governance to promote sustainable economic growth.
                            br
                            br
                        p.fs-20.fw-semibold.text-secondary 
                            | Why Attend
                        p.fs-20.fw-normal.text-secondary
                            | Join the global registry community to share experiences, explore innovative solutions, and shape the future of business registration and governance. The conference offers a unique opportunity to collaborate, learn, and contribute to policy advancements that impact businesses worldwide.
